	"notice": "MIDI output only; there is no USB MIDI or MIDI input. Tracks T1-TK send on channels 1-4. MIDI notes follow the selected scale, not the analog CV knob values. Use a Type A TRS MIDI adapter. Physical keys remain unbound because scale and pattern settings determine notes. This keyboard produces control signals rather than audio. Exact browser port names are unverified; select this profile manually. Diagrams show selected physical controls schematically, not a complete panel inventory. Unbound controls do not imply fixed MIDI assignments.",
